  "description": "This mod revamps over 250 unit cards to pretty ladies. This does NOT change any 3d models in game.\n\nThis is obviously not lore accurate.\n\nHowever, I tried to stick with the spirit of the original art.\n\nFactions covered:\n\nEmpire\n\nBretonnia\n\nHigh Elves\n\nDark Elves\n\nWood Elves\n\nNorsca\n\nKislev\n\nCathay\n\nChaos Undivided\n\nKhorne\n\nNurgle\n\nSlaanesh\n\nTzeentch\n\nVampire Counts\n\nNon-ROR cards have both an infopic and icon (RORs only have icons excluding Tattersouls).\n\nThe gallery images may be slightly out of date. It's a pain to keep them updated.\n\nChaos factions may come later.\n\nUnit cards:\n\n<https://www.loverslab.com/uploads/monthly_2023_01/image.png.ef0507c670365403a322f8947d4e09cb.png>\n\nROR cards:\n\n[img https://www.loverslab.com/uploads/monthly_2023_01/image.png.c90627443ee3d98501b62d3d357f88ad.png]\n\nNSFW units:\n\n[img https://www.loverslab.com/uploads/monthly_2023_02/image.png.7aa24537f11c7b837020b40a2b8f2484.png]\n\nInstallation instructions:\n\nDrop the .pack file into your /data directory in your game directory.\n\nex: C:\\your\\pathTotal War WARHAMMER III\\data\n\nIf you want the NSFW unit cards with the SFW ones, put the NSFW mod at a higher load priority.",
